<v Ad Tape>This is Big Trak, the computer-activated truck from MB Electronics. Program in up to 16 commands and Big Trak will advance, turn, and fire three blasts.
<v Ad Tape>这是Big Trak，MB电子推出的计算机激活卡车。输入最多16个指令，Big Trak就会前进、转弯并发射三次冲击。

