<v David Kestenbaum>Milton Bradley sold lots of them-- quite a few in Glenside, Pennsylvania, where I grew up. I remember them popping up in friends' houses after Christmas. And those ads were all over TV-- Big Trak rolling across the floor in the suburban living room and delivering an apple to dad.
<v David Kestenbaum>米尔顿·布拉德利卖了很多——我在长大的格伦赛德（Glenside）宾夕法尼亚州见到了不少。记得圣诞节过后，朋友家里都会出现这些玩具。电视上到处都是那些广告——Big Trak在郊区的客厅地板上滚来滚去，给爸爸送上一个苹果。

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.580
<v Ad Tape>Big Trak for your child from MB Electronics. Transporter sold separately.
